      {
        "id": 136539,
        "name": "cmschex",
        "username": "cmschex",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/e9bcb4/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-04T22:49:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>1 Prole=all Proles and they all share a health pool. &nbsp;So Defensive Sacrifice is a great card if you want to run up into the thick of things and not risk getting incapped. &nbsp;Essentially, as long as you still have 1 clone safe somewhere, you can get a clone to the front lines and if it takes a big hit, it goes away instead of the character taking damage. &nbsp;That Proletariat is the one being targeted with the attack that does damage</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:12:45.300Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
