        "raw": "<p>1 Prole=all Proles and they all share a health pool. &nbsp;So Defensive Sacrifice is a great card if you want to run up into the thick of things and not risk getting incapped. &nbsp;Essentially, as long as you still have 1 clone safe somewhere, you can get a clone to the front lines and if it takes a big hit, it goes away instead of the character taking damage. &nbsp;That Proletariat is the one being targeted with the attack that does damage</p>",
